  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Bring water to a boil in a large saucepan. Break up the block of noodles and stir into the pot, reserving seasoning packet. Stir in chicken, bok choy, and carrot. Bring to a boil again, then reduce heat and simmer for 3 minutes. Stir in contents of seasoning packet and sesame oil.",
